     1-input / 1-SpentUTXO / InputIndex=0 is internally consistent. Serialize uses the same txid, vout, sequence, outputs, version, locktime, sig, and pubkey.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Flags:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   1. SpentUTXOs[0].Script is not the fetched UTXO script. utxo.ScriptPubKey is ignored. SignP2QPKInput’s ErrFromAddrScriptMismatch check is tautological here (it compares a script derived from FromAddr to a script also derived from FromAddr). If scantxoutset ever returned a mismatched outpoint, you would sign an invalid sighash and still consume the change address. The derivation does match this specific mainnet UTXO (522028b97d…bb0f7c, confirmed in internal/rpcclient/realdata_test.go:34-48). Cross-check utxo.ScriptPubKey == hex(fromScript) before signing.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   2. SpentUTXOs[0].Amount is float64-converted, not an integer from the node:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │           utxoSats := int64(utxo.Amount*float64(rpcclient.SatoshisPerQOGE) + 0.5)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   scantxoutset emits ValueFromAmount ("22.00000000" as a JSON number). For 22 QOGE this round-trips to exactly 2_200_000_000. An off-by-one sat here would invalidate hashAmounts on-chain. Harden later with json.Number → QOGEToSatoshis.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   3. Zero/dust change output always included (see §3).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   4. To-dropdown is wallet FRESH only — cannot pay an external bq1z…. Fine if this first spend is internal.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   5. After sign, To is not marked PENDING; From stays PENDING until CLI OnConfirmation. Operational, not a signing bug.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
