 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   5. Fee handling — PASS                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   FixedFeeSats = 10_000 at 22:22:internal/txbuilder/txbuilder.go.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Used once: feeSats := txbuilder.FixedFeeSats then CalcChange(utxoSats, sendSats, feeSats) (388:389:cmd/gui/main.go). There is no fee output. Identity:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   utxoSats = sendSats + changeSats + FixedFeeSats                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Implicit fee in the serialized tx is exactly 10,000 sats. Not subtracted again at serialize/sign time. Insufficient-funds path surfaces the error and does not sign.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Fee vs size: 1-in 2-out P2QPK is 17,264 bytes, weight 17,675, vsize 4,419. 10000/4419 ≈ 2.26 sat/vB, above default minRelayTxFee (1,000 sat/kvB). Not silently dropped.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Flag: if float conversion of utxo.Amount were off by 1 sat, the implicit fee would be 9999 or 10001 and (worse) sighash hashAmounts would not match the UTXO set. Not an issue at 22.00000000 QOGE.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
