 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Operational checklist before the real spend                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   1. Confirm DEPLOYMENT_P2QPK is ACTIVE (getblockchaininfo). Until it is, that P2QPK UTXO is anyone-can-spend; a competing empty-witness spend can race you.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   │█
 │   2. Send a round amount well under 22 − 0.0001. Do not send 21.9999. Leave ≥ 330 sats change.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 │█
 │   3. Click Test in Mempool before sendrawtransaction. That is the last check that serialization, dust, fee, and SLH-DSA verify all agree with the node.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        │█
 │   4. You need two distinct FRESH addresses (To ≠ auto-change). Pool of 20 is enough.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           │█
 │   5. After confirmation, OnConfirmation on From is still CLI-only.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
 │   Nothing in these five paths is a “do not sign” FAIL for a 1-input, 2-output spend of ~1 QOGE (or similar) from the 22 QOGE UTXO with change ≫ dust. The dust-at-exact-balance behavior and the unused scriptPubKey cross-check are the two things I would not want to discover at broadcast time.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            │█
